*FoomaticRIPOptionSetting Quality=draft: " -t  "
*Quality normal/Normal: "%% FoomaticRIPOptionSetting: Quality=normal"
*FoomaticRIPOptionSetting Quality=normal: "  "
*CloseUI: *Quality

